  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>I</strong>nstall: Clinic</p>\n<p><strong>Humanity Loss:</strong> 14 (4d6)</p>\n<p><em>Run the edge at top speed, choomba. There ain’t another way to live.</em></p>\n<p>Speedware. As an Action, the user may activate this cyberware, after which it remains active for the next 60 seconds (20 Rounds). While active, this cyberware provides a +3 bonus to any Initiative Roll made. If activated while the user is already in an Initiative Queue, their current Initiative increases by 3, which is lost if this cyberware deactivates or its duration expires during combat. This cyberware has a 1 hour cooldown before it can be activated again. Only 1 piece of Speedware can be installed at a time.</p>\n<p><strong>Type:</strong> Neuralware<br>\n<strong>Install:</strong> Clinic<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> uses 1</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Replaces the core system's Sandevistan; use this one instead of the core item.</li>\n<li>Matches the core item's setup: the +3 shows as a toggle in the initiative roll dialog.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Neuralware).</em></p>"
